OL,3,GNEWSAHow wind farm plans are
OL,4,Ainfluencing Manx voters ahead of
OL,5,Aelection
OL,6,
OL,7,FWith Isle of Man voters heading to the
OL,8,Fpolls for the island's general
OL,9,Felection, plans for a major offshore
OL,10,Fwind farm have become an increasingly
OL,11,Fthorny political issue.
OL,13,FThe proposed Mooir Vannin project has
OL,14,Fbeen put forward by Danish energy firm
OL,15,FOrsted, and would see 87 turbines built
OL,16,Fsix to 12 miles (11.1km to 22.2km) off
OL,17,Fthe eastern coast of Maughold.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,448,445,260,140,0,100
