OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F447A1787570792
OL,1,W5j 5Q5wsj  ws jkjs j#7kjs57k
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%,.*,$-, *.*  * %** %%* (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHow wind farm plans are
OL,4,Ainfluencing Manx voters ahead of
OL,5,Aelection
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe plans are currently under an
OL,8,Findependent examination, which is
OL,9,Fexpected to close on 9 September, with
OL,10,Fa final recommendation expected early
OL,11,Fnext year.
OL,13,FThe final decision will be made by a
OL,14,Ffuture Council of Ministers, meaning
OL,15,Fmany residents ready to cast their vote
OL,16,Fon 24 September are choosing their MHKs
OL,17,Fwith this topic in mind.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
